{"kind": "assistant", "data": {"role": "assistant", "content": "", "responses_output": [{"id": "fc_07d3f500687c52ac016afe5f98409487d093909d7e0d3f5d77", "type": "function_call", "status": "completed", "arguments": "{\"name\":\"pick_up_object\"}", "call_id": "call_PK8YGCcHgwNevcG70bygKor7", "name": "read_experience"}, {"id": "fc_07d3f500687c52ac016afe5f9840ac87d0b6aaad0b99f7e72b", "type": "function_call", "status": "completed", "arguments": "{\"query\":\"computer mouse\"}", "call_id": "call_UP4lIwBZX9CIoedm5CmHvxjG", "name": "find_objects"}, {"id": "fc_07d3f500687c52ac016afe5f9840b887d0b9e49760d2f50b33", "type": "function_call", "status": "completed", "arguments": "{}", "call_id": "call_QfKRh8fNSVyLni0qnT5p4Wbz", "name": "get_robot_state"}], "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_PK8YGCcHgwNevcG70bygKor7", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "read_experience", "arguments": "{\"name\":\"pick_up_object\"}"}}, {"id": "call_UP4lIwBZX9CIoedm5CmHvxjG", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "find_objects", "arguments": "{\"query\":\"computer mouse\"}"}}, {"id": "call_QfKRh8fNSVyLni0qnT5p4Wbz", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "get_robot_state", "arguments": "{}"}}]}}
{"kind": "tool", "data": {"name": "read_experience", "result": {"ok": true, "name": "pick_up_object", "when": "从桌上拿起 / 抓起一个东西", "status": "真机成功 1 次(2026-11-14,鼠标)", "content": "## 原则\n- 夹爪从正上方竖直下去,张开的两指罩住物体两侧,再闭合。侧面去抓会把东西推走,还容易扫到桌面。\n- 物体坐标是相机看到的表面(放在桌上的东西就是顶面)的中心,不是底。所以“下到物体”要越过顶面继续往下,\n  直到夹爪尖碰到桌面才算到底 —— touch_object 在 gap_cm=0 时就是这么做的(六维力碰到就停),停下后自动退 2 厘米,给闭合留空间。\n\n## 做法\n1. find_objects 找到它,记下 object_id\n2. approach_object(object_id, tool_axis=\"down\"):夹爪朝下停在它上方(悬停高度不用填)\n3. gripper(action=\"open\")\n4. touch_object(object_id, gap_cm=0):往下直到碰到,自动退 2 厘米。看结果里的 contact.felt\n5. gripper(action=\"close\")\n6. move_arm_end(offset_cm=[0, 0, 10]):抬起\n\n一共 6 次运动。\n\n## 常见坑\n- contact.felt 为 false:一路没碰到东西,夹爪可能还在半空。先告诉用户,不要直接闭合当作抓到了。\n- 程序可能先让上身前倾(结果里有 body_assist),腰不会自己回去。之后要回原位用 go_to_pose。\n- 夹爪不回报开合位置,gripper 返回 ok 只说明命令发出去了,不说明抓住了。\n\n## 怎么确认成功\n- 抬起后再 find_objects 找一次:抓住了,物体会跟着夹爪(坐标在夹爪尖附近、比原来高);原来的位置不再有它。\n- 找不到、或者还在原来的位置:没抓住,如实告诉用户。"}}}
